# Akimbo's two rings at once (Rerac-vr's OffHandRing): both sticks clicked, the left hand's ring on the left, the right
# hand's at the right edge, each hand reaching for its own slot, each trigger turning its own page. The left lets go
# first: its pick goes to the left hand and the right ring stays. The right lets go after: the right hand takes its pick.
# A second go opens the right ring alone, then the left, and the menu button recentres on the way.
